<title>USA: Worldwide Equipment gets funding.</title>
<headline>Worldwide Equipment gets funding.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Worldwide Equipment Corp said Thursday it received $756,000 in a private placement funding.</p>
<p>&quot;This capital infusion will help us attain the next step in our international expansion program,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>At present, the company said it is in the process of seeking an additional $5 million in capital.</p>
<p>Worldwide Equipment is an international trading company primarily engaged in purchasing and selling new and used heavy-duty construction and earthmoving equipment on a world-wide basis.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
